    "text": "Tins of March 2013, each with one of three Boundaries Crossed Pokémon-EX with new art, Keldeo-EX BW61, Black Kyurem-EX BW62 or White Kyurem-EX BW63, one of two non-holo Meloetta cards packed at random (BW68 in its Aria Forme, BW69 in its Pirouette Forme), four Black & White Series booster packs and a code card for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. Each Pokémon-EX was redrawn by the artist of the Boundaries Crossed card.",
